---
// Email capture block — your single most important audience-building tool.
//
// Right now this is a non-functional demo form. To make it live, sign up for
// a free email provider (MailerLite or Kit/ConvertKit), create an audience,
// and either:
//   (a) paste their embed form code in place of the <form> below, OR
//   (b) point the `action` at their form endpoint.
// Both providers give you copy-paste HTML. No backend needed.
---
<section class="signup">
  <h3>Don't miss the next signal</h3>
  <p>The week's most credible UAP stories, filed to your inbox. No spam, no lizard-people conspiracies (unless corroborated).</p>
  <form action="#" method="post" onsubmit="alert('Connect your email provider to enable signups — see EmailSignup.astro'); return false;">
    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@earth.com" required />
    <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
  </form>
  <p class="small">Free. Unsubscribe anytime. We never sell your data to any government — foreign, domestic, or otherwise.</p>
</section>
